角色形象素材 —— 保留所有权利

Copyright (c) 2026 visitor257. All rights reserved.

This directory and everything under it (characters/**, including every pack
under _archive/) is the character artwork of Ponko HUD: the source
illustrations in src/, the block-character frames and their metadata in
frames/ (the .ans, .json, pack.json and preview.html files derived from
them), and any future packs.

These files are NOT covered by the MIT license that applies to the source
code of Ponko HUD (see ../LICENSE).

You may:

  - run Ponko HUD with these assets as shipped;
  - build it from source for your own private use, and use that build
    yourself;
  - keep them inside a fork or clone of this repository, as long as they are
    not separated from the project and redistributed on their own — keeping
    them in a fork covers publishing the fork's source, not shipping builds
    (see the first item under "You may not");
  - show screenshots or recordings of the running application, as they are —
    pulling a frame out of that footage to use it as a thumbnail, cover image
    or avatar is not covered by this item (see the third item under "You may
    not");
  - quote the artwork unmodified, with credit to the project, in
    non-commercial writing that introduces, reviews or references Ponko HUD.

You may not:

  - distribute any build, package, installer or store submission that
    contains the artwork. This covers an APK, AAB, zip, installer or any
    other installable form of this project or of a fork, whether or not the
    source is published alongside it, and whether or not it is offered for
    free. You may build and run it for yourself; you may not hand the build
    to anyone else, or upload it to an app store, package registry, download
    site or any other distribution channel;
  - use the artwork for any commercial purpose without the author's prior
    written permission (ask through the project repository);
  - modify it, recolor it, redraw it, or use it as a base for derivative
    work — avatars, banners, video thumbnails or covers, merchandise, other
    characters;
  - extract it from this project and redistribute it on its own, in any
    format, including repackaged asset collections — the non-commercial
    quoting allowed above is the only exception.

Any other use, including non-commercial uses that go beyond what is spelled
out above, needs the author's permission: ask through the project repository
first.

All rights not expressly granted above are reserved by the author.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

本目录及其下所有内容（characters/ 全部子目录，含 _archive/ 里的每个包）是
Ponko HUD 的角色形象素材：src/ 里的原图、frames/ 里由它们生成的方块字符帧
与元数据（.ans、.json、pack.json、preview.html），以及以后新增的包。

这些文件**不适用** Ponko HUD 源码的 MIT 许可（见 ../LICENSE）。

你可以：

  - 按原样运行 Ponko HUD 并使用这些素材；
  - 从源码自行构建，供**自己**使用；
  - 在 fork 或克隆的本仓库里保留它们，前提是它们没有被单独摘出来再分发。
    在 fork 里保留，指的是把 fork 的**源码**公开发布，**不包括**把构建产物发出去
    （见下方"你不可以"第一条）；
  - 展示运行中应用的截图或录像（原样展示）：把画面里的一帧截出来当封面、缩略图
    或头像，不在这一条允许的范围内（见下方"你不可以"第三条）；
  - 在**非商业**的介绍、评测、引用文章里贴出**未经修改**的素材，并注明出处。

你不可以：

  - 分发任何包含这些素材的构建产物、安装包或商店提交物。包括本项目或 fork 打出来的
    APK、AAB、压缩包、安装程序等一切可安装形态 —— 无论是否同时公开源码，
    也无论是否免费提供。你可以自己构建自己用，但不可以把构建结果交给别人，
    也不可以上传到应用商店、软件包仓库、下载站或任何其他分发渠道；
  - 未经作者书面许可将素材用于任何商业用途（可先在仓库开 issue 联系）；
  - 修改、改色、重绘，或作为衍生作品的素材 —— 头像、横幅、视频封面或缩略图、
    周边、其他角色；
  - 把素材从本项目里摘出来，以任何格式单独再分发（包括打包成素材集）——
    上面明文允许的非商业引用是唯一例外。

超出上面明文范围的其它用途（包括非商业用途）：请先在仓库开 issue 征得同意。

上面没有明确授予的权利，一律保留。
